18,P1757351396947838,unknown,4PFUQ6ZY,4627286,47,,,,,[],f,,"[{""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_1"", ""description_A"": ""The robot picks up the knife, moves it over, and places it down neatly and precisely in the space between the pot and the pepper shaker. The action is smooth and successful without disturbing any other objects.\n\n"", ""description_B"": ""The robot approaches the knife but fails to grasp it properly, instead pushing it slightly and knocking into the pepper shaker. It does not successfully pick up or move the knife to the correct location.\n\n""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""same_7"", ""description_A"": ""The robot approaches the knife and manages to grasp it. It lifts the knife but moves it in a somewhat clumsy arc. It ends up placing the knife down, but it's very close to the pepper shaker, not really in the clear space between the two objects. The placement is awkward and not very precise.\n\n"", ""description_B"": ""The robot picks up the knife smoothly, moves it in a direct path, and places it down perfectly in the middle of the space between the pot and the pepper shaker. The action is confident and the final placement is neat and correct.\n\n""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_18"", ""description_A"": ""The robot approaches the knife but completely misses the grasp. Its gripper closes on empty air above the knife. It then moves away without having picked up the object, failing the task entirely.\n\n"", ""description_B"": ""The robot successfully grasps the knife, lifts it, and moves it to the space between the pot and the pepper shaker. It places the knife down carefully and precisely in the correct location, completing the task successfully.\n\n""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""right_22"", ""description_A"": ""The robot successfully picks up the knife, moves it over, and places it down neatly in the space between the pot and the pepper shaker. The action is smooth and the placement looks correct.\n\n"", ""description_B"": ""The robot approaches the knife but seems to misjudge the distance. It pushes the knife slightly instead of grasping it properly, then knocks into the pepper shaker, moving it out of place. It fails to pick up or move the knife to the target location.\n\n""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_24"", ""description_A"": ""The robot approaches the knife but completely misses the grasp. The gripper closes too high above the knife handle, grabbing nothing. It then moves away without the object, failing to even pick it up.\n\n"", ""description_B"": ""The robot successfully grasps the knife, lifts it up, and moves it to the area between the pot and pepper shaker. It places the knife down carefully in the correct spot, completing the task neatly.\n\n""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_93"", ""description_A"": ""The robot approaches the pot and successfully picks it up. It moves the pot over the towel but places it down right on the very edge. The pot is partially on the towel but mostly hanging off, which is a precarious and not very successful placement.\n\n"", ""description_B"": ""The robot picks up the pot smoothly, moves it directly to the center of the towel, and places it down neatly. The pot is completely on the towel and the placement is secure and correct.\n\n""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""right_360"", ""description_A"": ""The robot picks up the spoon and moves it to the left side of the cloth, placing it down neatly. The placement is correct and the spoon is clearly positioned to the left of the cloth.\n\n"", ""description_B"": ""The robot approaches the spoon but fails to grasp it properly. It nudges the spoon slightly to the side without lifting it, then moves away without completing the task. The spoon remains in its original position, not moved to the left of the cloth.\n\n""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_1174"", ""description_A"": ""The robot picks up the banana, moves it over the colander, and successfully drops it inside. The banana lands securely in the colander, completing the task.\n\n"", ""description_B"": ""The robot picks up the banana but moves it too quickly or inaccurately. It misses the colander entirely, dropping the banana on the table next to it instead of inside. The task is failed.\n\n""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_1235"", ""description_A"": ""The robot successfully picks up the banana, moves it over the colander, and places it inside. The banana is securely in the colander and the task is completed correctly.\n\n"", ""description_B"": ""The robot picks up the banana but moves it too far past the colander. It drops the banana on the table behind the colander instead of inside it. The task is failed.\n\n""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_1653"", ""description_A"": ""The robot picks up the red object, moves it over the pot, and successfully drops it inside. The object lands securely in the pot, completing the task correctly.\n\n"", ""description_B"": ""The robot approaches the red object but fails to grasp it properly. It pushes the object around without picking it up, then knocks it off the table. The object falls to the ground and is never placed in the pot.\n\n""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""right_1164"", ""description_A"": ""The robot successfully picks up the silver pot, moves it directly over the blue cloth, and places it down neatly and centered on top of the cloth. The placement is precise and the task is completed correctly.\n\n"", ""description_B"": ""The robot picks up the silver pot but moves it too far past the cloth. It places the pot down on the table next to the blue cloth instead of on top of it. The task is failed.\n\n""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_1102"", ""description_A"": ""The robot picks up the silver pot and moves it toward the blue cloth. However, it places the pot down only partially on the cloth, with a significant portion hanging off the edge. The placement is unstable and not fully successful.\n\n"", ""description_B"": ""The robot successfully picks up the silver pot, moves it directly over the center of the blue cloth, and places it down neatly and completely on top of the cloth. The placement is secure and the task is completed correctly.\n\n""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_1568"", ""description_A"": ""nice and smooth"", ""description_B"": ""not good ""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_2036"", ""description_A"": ""nice and smooth"", ""description_B"": ""not good ""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_1242"", ""description_A"": ""good"", ""description_B"": ""not good ""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""right_1032"", ""description_A"": ""the robot reaches not reach"", ""description_B"": ""the robot reached""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_607"", ""description_A"": ""the robot reached"", ""description_B"": ""the robot reaches not reach""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_437"", ""description_A"": ""the robot reached"", ""description_B"": ""the robot not reach""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_759"", ""description_A"": ""the robot reached"", ""description_B"": ""the robot not reach""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_315"", ""description_A"": ""the robot reached"", ""description_B"": ""the robot not reach""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_1276"", ""description_A"": ""the robot reached\n"", ""description_B"": ""the robot not reach""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""right_2121"", ""description_A"": ""the robot not reach"", ""description_B"": ""the robot reached""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""left_787"", ""description_A"": ""the robot reached"", ""description_B"": ""the robot not reach""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""right_1309"", ""description_A"": ""the robot not reach"", ""description_B"": ""the robot reached""}, {""type"": ""regular"", ""answer"": ""right_939"", ""description_A"": "