able."", ""description_B"": ""The robot makes no meaningful move and does not interact with the milk bottle or the table.""}, {""type"": ""sanity_check"", ""answer"": ""same_3171"", ""correct"": false, ""description_A"": ""The robot reaches for the stuffed dog, picks it up, and attempts to place it inside the pot."", ""description_B"": ""The robot makes no meaningful move and does not interact with the stuffed dog or the pot.""}]",2026-02-26 03:28:11.626,v1.0-official,2026-02-26 03:28:12.567621
