164,A2BK919J29TOEE,paid,54PR46BN,3734275,45,10,10,6,7,"[{""index"": 200, ""correct"": true, ""position"": 4, ""userAnswer"": ""right"", ""correctAnswer"": ""right""}, {""index"": 1, ""correct"": true, ""position"": 5, ""userAnswer"": ""left"", ""correctAnswer"": ""left""}, {""index"": 100, ""correct"": true, ""position"": 12, ""userAnswer"": ""left"", ""correctAnswer"": ""left""}, {""index"": 7411, ""correct"": true, ""position"": 14, ""userAnswer"": ""right"", ""correctAnswer"": ""right""}, {""index"": 3104, ""correct"": true, ""position"": 25, ""userAnswer"": ""right"", ""correctAnswer"": ""right""}, {""index"": 2700, ""correct"": false, ""position"": 28, ""userAnswer"": ""same"", ""correctAnswer"": ""left""}, {""index"": 2800, ""correct"": true, ""position"": 33, ""userAnswer"": ""left"", ""correctAnswer"": ""left""}]",f,,"[{""type"": ""quiz"", ""answer"": ""left_2548"", ""correct"": true, ""description_A"": ""The robot extends its arm toward the blue spoon, grasps it securely, lifts it from the surface, moves it over the green cloth, and places it down on top of the cloth before releasing its grip."", ""description_B"": ""The robot makes a slight movement toward the objects but does not successfully grasp the blue spoon or place it on the green cloth. The task is not completed.""}, {""type"": ""quiz"", ""answer"": ""right_4683"", ""correct"": true, ""description_A"": ""The robot moves its arm toward the cylinder, grasps it firmly, lifts it slightly off the surface, and shifts it to the right side of the chess pawn. It then lowers the cylinder into position and releases it, successfully completing the task."", ""description_B"": ""The robot approaches the cylinder but fails to grasp it properly. It either nudges it slightly without clear control or does not move it to the correct position relative to the chess pawn. The task is not successfully completed.""}, {""type"": ""quiz"", ""answer"": ""same_8231"", ""correct"": true, ""description_A"": ""The robot reaches toward the knife, closes its gripper around the handle, lifts the knife off the surface, and moves it over the cutting board. It then lowers the knife onto the board and releases it, placing it securely on top."", ""description_B"": ""The robot moves its arm slightly but does not successfully grasp the knife. It either misses the handle or fails to lift the knife, and the knife is not placed on the cutting board.""}, {""type"": ""quiz"", ""answer"": ""right_650"", ""correct"": true, ""description_A"": ""The robot reaches toward the green cloth, grips it securely, and lifts it from its original position. It then moves the cloth across the table toward the bottom left area, positioning it below the yellow pepper. The robot lowers the cloth and releases it in the correct location, completing the task."", ""description_B"": ""The robot moves its arm toward the green cloth but does not successfully grasp or relocate it. The cloth either remains in its original position or is moved without being placed below the yellow pepper in the bottom left area. The task is not completed.""}, {""type"": ""quiz"", ""answer"": ""right_4790"", ""correct"": true, ""description_A"": ""The robot extends its arm toward the cylinder, closes its gripper around it, and lifts it from the table. It then moves the cylinder to the right side of the chess pawn, lowers it into place, and releases it, successfully completing the task."", ""description_B"": ""The robot makes a partial movement toward the cylinder but does not properly grasp or relocate it. The cylinder either remains in its original position or is not placed to the right of the chess pawn. The task is not successfully completed.""}, {""type"": ""quiz"", ""answer"": ""left_695"", ""correct"": true, ""description_A"": ""The robot reaches toward the green cloth, grasps it securely, and lifts it off the table. It then moves the cloth to the bottom left area of the table, positioning it directly below the yellow pepper. The robot lowers the cloth and releases it in the correct spot, successfully completing the task."", ""description_B"": ""The robot attempts to move toward the green cloth but does not successfully pick it up or reposition it. The cloth remains in its original location or is placed somewhere other than the bottom left area below the yellow pepper. The task is not completed.""}, {""type"": ""quiz"", ""answer"": ""left_14"", ""correct"": true, ""description_A"": ""The robot reaches toward the can, grips it securely, and lifts it off the surface. It then moves the can to the right side of the pot, carefully lowers it into position, and releases it, successfully completing the task."", ""description_B"": ""The robot makes a slight movement toward the can but does not successfully grasp or relocate it. The can either remains in its original position or is not placed to the right of the pot. The task is not completed.""}, {""type"": ""quiz"", ""answer"": ""same_25"", ""correct"": true, ""description_A"": ""The robot moves its arm toward the can, closes its gripper around it, and lifts it from the table. It then carries the can to the right side of the pot, lowers it into position, and releases it, successfully placing it in the correct location."", ""description_B"": ""The robot approaches the can but fails to grasp it properly or does not move it to the correct position. The can either stays where it started or is placed somewhere other than to the right of the pot. The task is not successfully completed.""}, {""type"": ""quiz"", ""answer"": ""left_52"", ""correct"": true, ""description_A"": ""The robot reaches toward the can, secures it with its gripper, and lifts it off the table. It then moves the can to the right side of the pot, lowers it carefully into place, and releases it, completing the task successfully."", ""description_B"": ""The robot makes an incomplete attempt, either failing to grasp the can or not moving it to the correct position. The can remains in its original spot or